WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.801 --> 00:00:06.351
To begin, load a GPX file: the panel button, or simply drag and drop one.

2
00:00:28.115 --> 00:00:33.235
The map frames the track. The start is marked in green, the finish in red.

3
00:00:34.429 --> 00:00:39.897
The Play button replays the route: a blue dot moves along the track, and the profile follows.

4
00:00:45.743 --> 00:00:48.448
The Stop button goes back to the whole track.
